'''Zoroark''' (Japanese: '''ゾロアーク''' ''Zoroark'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

