==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration from the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion was first featured on {{TCG ID|Emerging Powers|Zoroark|67}} from the {{TCG|Emerging Powers}} expansion.
*{{m|Night Daze}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Zoroark}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

